    "4a0fad086b091a4f8b20e386e4b0bac1ce09dd832adfcf72bca0c22f6251127a": {
      "normalizationVersion": 1,
      "sourceHash": "2da63e4830d0574c571911939f4ae18109e01741b3405b8a7c8a358b44aeff70",
      "contextFingerprint": "334381918947006220c8b5c8283d156f6a6b45bd733498b9b44cda81462f819d",
      "sourceText": "总的来说，SSH更适合需要执行命令行操作和快速访问的场景，而NoMachine更适合需要图形界面远程桌面访问的场景。选择哪种方式应该根据具体的需求和使用习惯来决定。",
      "translatedText": "In general, SSH is more suitable for scenarios that require command\\-line operations and quick access, while NoMachine is more suitable for scenarios that require remote desktop access with a graphical interface\\. The choice between the two should be determined based on specific needs and usage habits\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 166,
