    "4a101e0afe2e4c2dd5467eeb59442312f740c9f5d48d87238e8014614a39386c": {
      "normalizationVersion": 1,
      "sourceHash": "2cf0ee9f86b0672508d1cadfa20bc267c60f890397d49d7cccd909493adec7b0",
      "contextFingerprint": "e3720c82b43a89abf2317bd547d46aa0f1218ddad0dad111d946503dec81a5d4",
      "sourceText": "1. **函数返回多值时优先用 `std::tuple`/`std::pair` + 结构化绑定**，而不是输出参数。\n2. **C++17 中只读遍历 map 时优先用 `const auto& [key, value]`**，避免拷贝，也能清楚表达 key 和 value 的含义。\n3. **解包 insert 返回值**：C++17 的 `auto [it, inserted] = map.insert(...)` 比继续使用 `.first`、`.second` 更直观。\n4. **需要修改原数据时使用 `auto&`**；只读且不想拷贝时使用 `const auto&`。\n5. **维护 C++17 以前的项目时继续使用原有访问方式**：pair 用 `.first/.second`，tuple 用 `std::get<N>()`。",
      "translatedText": "1. **When a function returns multiple values, prefer `std::tuple`/`std::pair` \\+ structured bindings** rather than output parameters\\.\n2. **C++17 When performing read\\-only traversal of a map, prefer `const auto& [key, value]`** to avoid copies and to clearly express the meaning of the key and value\\.\n3. **Unpacking the return value of insert**： C++17's `auto [it, inserted] = map.insert(...)` is more intuitive than continuing to use `.first`、`.second`\\.\n4. **Use `auto&`** when the original data needs to be modified; use `const auto&` when it is read\\-only and you do not want to copy\\.\n5. **When maintaining projects from before C++17, continue to use the original access methods**： use `.first/.second` for pair, and use `std::get<N>()` for tuple\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 270,
        "outputTokens": 165,
        "costUsd": 0.000279
      }
    },
